# FE8 Gate 0 key file (format: port/test/README.md, "Input file"). Save checks P5.3 and P5.4
# (port/test/README.md, "Save checks"; port/test/tools/savechk.sh). Hand-made from frame dumps
# of the played build, not from a TAS.
# Start: ch1_seize.sav (made by mGBA, README 'Chapter saves'). Resume Chapter 1 (Eirika's seize), the end of Chapter 1, the save menu with slot 2 picked (a game save, Chapter 2), the world map, Chapter 2 to its first player phase (suspend saves). chapsave_frelia.keys with one Down added at 4,500.
# 7600 ticks; each press is held 2 ticks. The played builds take it as FE8PC_KEYSCRIPT
# (port/test/tools/keys_to_keyscript.py; frame N is tick N on the lag-free PC).
#
